MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The WYZE camera fits my repeated interest in home monitoring, and color night vision offers a specific benefit beyond simply adding another camera.",
    "The Echo Dot with a clock and the smart plug feel like useful additions to my Fire TV setup: voice control, a visible clock, and lamp automation have clear everyday uses."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The internal SSDs assume I am upgrading a computer, but my recent purchases concern home viewing and monitoring rather than computer storage projects.",
    "The charging cables and wired earbuds solve needs I have not expressed, while the 16TB drive is more storage than I currently need even though I have bought video equipment."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning several electronic devices seems to have been treated as a reason to suggest broadly related electronics, even when they serve different purposes.",
    "My camera and DVR purchases seem to have been taken as evidence that I need storage generally, without a clear recording need or confirmed compatibility."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Practical fit matters: wired power limits where I could put the WYZE camera, and I would need to check supported capacity before choosing the microSD card.",
    "I choose additions for a specific use rather than buying every compatible device. I would choose the clock-equipped Echo Dot over the standard version, not buy both."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my home monitoring and Fire TV interests but stretch them too broadly into unrelated electronics and storage upgrades."
}
